---- MODULE live_reset__strong_step__always_eventually_action ----
EXTENDS Integers
VARIABLE x
Next == x' = IF x = 0 THEN 2 ELSE x - 1
Spec == x = 2 /\ [][Next]_x /\ SF_x(x = 1 /\ Next)
Prop == []<><<x' = 0>>_x
====

